{"id":"d7650db2ba55e66d","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-functional-continuity.md","title":"泛函的有限见证与连续性","display":"thm-functional-continuity — 泛函的有限见证与连续性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-functional-continuity","aliases":["20-thm-functional-continuity"],"display":"thm-functional-continuity — 泛函的有限见证与连续性","chapter":"3","section":"3.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 3.3.8","source_pdf_pages":[92,93],"source_printed_pages":[56,57],"depends_on":["[[20-df-functional-graph]]","[[20-lem-use-preservation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-functional-continuity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-functional-continuity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-functional-continuity — 泛函的有限见证与连续性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 3.3.8"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92</span><span>93</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56</span><span>57</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"634b02102672cc2a\" href=\"?note=634b02102672cc2a\" title=\"20-df-functional-graph\">20-df-functional-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fec296dc8eb84564\" href=\"?note=fec296dc8eb84564\" title=\"20-lem-use-preservation\">20-lem-use-preservation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,y\\in\\omega\">\\(e,x,y\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"634b02102672cc2a\" href=\"?note=634b02102672cc2a\" title=\"20-df-functional-graph\">20-df-functional-graph</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fec296dc8eb84564\" href=\"?note=fec296dc8eb84564\" title=\"20-lem-use-preservation\">20-lem-use-preservation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}functional\\text{-}continuity}\\vdash\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\sigma\\preceq\\chi_A\\ [(\\sigma,x,y)\\in G_e].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}functional\\text{-}continuity}\\vdash\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\sigma\\preceq\\chi_A\\ [(\\sigma,x,y)\\in G_e].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向取长度不小于 use 的前缀；反向应用有限使用保持。每个输出的原像因此是可有效枚举的基本开集的并。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 3.3.8；印刷页 56, 57；PDF 第 92, 93 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-functional-graph","status":"resolved","id":"634b02102672cc2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-functional-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-use-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"fec296dc8eb84564","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-use-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-functional-graph","status":"resolved","id":"634b02102672cc2a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-functional-graph]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-use-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"fec296dc8eb84564","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-functional-graph]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"e,x,y\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}functional\\text{-}continuity}\\vdash\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\sigma\\preceq\\chi_A\\ [(\\sigma,x,y)\\in G_e].","display":true}],"bytes":1137,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["634b02102672cc2a","fec296dc8eb84564"]}